  "details": "OK, I understand that discord and that does exists so hear me out if you would kindly. I am not a mute, but i know friends who are. even those without VR. For them, they cant do much at all cause they cant communicate. Th emojis are only so helpful too.\nSO, I propose a solution! Add a keyboard that can be used both by Desktop people, and VR users. the text would be limited to timing and would be above or in front the player that has typed the said message so not to spam.  This would be a great inclusion and would be helpful. like the Tell your World. a keyboard to type that no longer works due to webpannels being...well RIP.\nSo for all the mutes, Add a way for them to talk. It isn't VRChat if you cant chat at all!",
